This privacy policy applies to the current Findragon fork of Findroid.

This fork is being prepared for DragonDB users and does not collect, sell, or share personal information, analytics data, or crash reporting data.

This fork was modified from upstream Findroid on 2026-05-02. Additional feature and branding changes may follow in later revisions.

Before any public distribution of this fork, publisher and contact details should be reviewed and updated for the intended maintainer or organization.
